==Irish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ga|/fˠaː/|q2=unstressed|/fˠa/|a=Ulster|ref2={{R:ga:Quiggin|110|313}}}}

===Etymology 1===

====Preposition====
{{ga-prep|d|l}}

# {{alternative form of|ga|faoi||about, concerning|from=Ulster}}

=====Usage notes=====
The standard Irish and Connacht form {{m|ga|faoi}} and the Munster form {{m|ga|fé}} mean both ‘under’ and ‘about, concerning’. In Ulster, these two meanings are split: {{m|ga|faoi}} means ‘under’, while {{m|ga||fá}} means ‘about, concerning’.

