* {{l|ga|fána}} corresponding to standard {{l|ga|faoina}}
* {{l|ga|fánar}} corresponding to standard {{l|ga|faoinar}}
* {{l|ga|fánár}} corresponding to standard {{l|ga|faoinár}}
* {{l|ga|fánarb}} corresponding to standard {{l|ga|faoinarb}}
